{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"That evening, after I had written to you, I took the carriage to Breda, where I saw the magnificent work by Michelangelo—a mausoleum. Six life-sized figures of white alabaster: a count and his wife, lying in death, and four figures: Julius Caesar, Hannibal, Regulus, and a warrior standing bent over at the four corners of the black stone on which they lie, carrying on their shoulders a similar black stone—a magnificent, spirited work by the greatest master."}}],"created":1795080246,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":105,"prompt_tokens":190,"total_tokens":295,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-xNkzfeWDtjQKZlC4Dmobux0HFWQdOLi7","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":190,"prompt_ms":380.893,"prompt_per_token_ms":2.0046999999999997,"prompt_per_second":498.8277547762758,"predicted_n":105,"predicted_ms":2527.615,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.303990384615382,"predicted_per_second":41.145506732631354}}